13. PRIVATE DATA ACCESS RULES

The following information is NOT publicly accessible:

- Collector identities
- Depot Agent identities
- Mobile Money transaction details
- Financial ledger balances
- Internal depot operations
- Administrative reports

Access is restricted based on user permissions.


--------------------------------------------------


14. BUSINESS RULES

- Unknown barcodes do not block collector payouts.
- Only verified products may enter the permanent catalog.
- Every barcode must be globally unique.
- Every transaction must be linked to a product record.
- Product records are never permanently deleted.
- Depot staff cannot edit the Master Barcode Catalog.
- Barcode scans contribute to environmental analytics automatically.


